### LMRouter API Requests
### Based on README.md API compatibility endpoints
### Server running on http://127.0.0.1:3000

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000
@apiKey = sk-example-key-1

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/

###

### OpenAI API Endpoints

### List Available Models (OpenAI)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openai/v1/models
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

###

### Chat Completions (OpenAI)
POST {{baseUrl}}/openai/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "openai/gpt-5",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hello! How are you today?"
    }
  ]
}

###

### Anthropic API Endpoints

### List Available Models (Anthropic)
GET {{baseUrl}}/anthropic/v1/models
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

###

### Messages (Anthropic)
POST {{baseUrl}}/anthropic/v1/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
anthropic-version: 2023-06-01

{
  "model": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-4",
  "max_tokens": 1024,
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hello! Can you explain what makes LMRouter special?"
    }
  ]
}

###

### Streaming Messages (Anthropic)
POST {{baseUrl}}/anthropic/v1/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
anthropic-version: 2023-06-01

{
  "model": "anthropic/claude-sonnet-4",
  "max_tokens": 1024,
  "stream": true,
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Tell me a story about AI."
    }
  ]
}

###

### V1 API Endpoints

### List All Available Models
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/models
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

###

### Test with OpenRouter (catch-all model)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "meta-llama/llama-3.1-405b-instruct",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hello! Can you help me understand how API routing works?"
    }
  ],
  "max_tokens": 300
}

###

### Error Testing - Invalid Model
POST {{baseUrl}}/openai/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "invalid/model-name",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "This should fail"
    }
  ]
}

###

### Error Testing - Invalid API Key
POST {{baseUrl}}/openai/v1/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer invalid-api-key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "openai/gpt-4o-transcribe",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "This should fail due to invalid API key"
    }
  ]
}